---
// StaticMitigationSection.astro - Static mitigation section (no React needed)
---

<section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
        Upaya Mitigasi Kebakaran
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Penyelenggaraan pencegahan, pemadaman, dan penanganan pasca karhutla
        berdasarkan Permen LHK Nomor 32 Tahun 2016
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Pencegahan Card -->
